{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はFNSうたの夏まつりに出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てもらえましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回歌ったのはおいでシャンプー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短かい時間だったけどものすごく緊張して、すごい楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大勢の方がペンライトを振りながら聞いてくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな大舞台で歌えたこと、本当に光栄です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また呼んでいただけるように頑張りますo(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わったあともしばらく観客席で見させていただいたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくすごかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと心臓がバクバクしてて、興奮が冷めませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか私達も、みなさんにこう思ってもらえるようなライブができたら幸せだなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ努力しなきゃいけないこといっぱい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても勉強になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日だったメンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7/23ろってぃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8/6かなりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(〃・ω・)ノ☆゜'・:*☆オメデト♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃってゴメンね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロッティーにはよくダンス教えてもらったりしてて、すごい助かってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るい笑顔が大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんは、誕生日の最後を私と一緒に過ごしたんだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（レッスン帰りでたまたまですが...）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもかまってくれてありがたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも仲良くしてね(o^v^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/2262943/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}